These aren't really spoilers, but I'll include the ^L anyway.

You can use a lock pick or a skeleton key to simply open the door and
get into the shop. Both the shopkeeper and the shop will then be just
as if the store had never been closed at all.

You can also simply kick down the door, but you will want to have the
200-400 coins that the Shopkeeper will demand from you to pay for the
broken door ("Cad!") If you can't pay be prepared to kill the
shopkeeper or else get your butt kicked.

Finally one can use the other standard techniques for getting into any
shop, such as teleporting in, digging your way in, etc.

